            "en": "FuelType"
          },
          "applicationProfileDefinition": {
            "en": "The type of fuel that is suitable for the vehicle's engine(s)."
          },
          "applicationProfileUsageNote": {
            "en": "The value comes from the Fuel Type code list, which adopts the IVI fuel codes. An engine specification can have multiple fuel types, for example, gasoline and LPG."
          },
