          },
          "applicationProfileLabel": {
            "en": "motorType"
          },
          "applicationProfileDefinition": {
            "en": "The type of engine or motors that drive the vehicle."
          },
          "applicationProfileUsageNote": {
            "en": "The value comes from the code list Engine type: combustion engine or electric motor. An engine Specification can have multiple engine Types to indicate that one registered engine Specification actually relates to multiple physical engines. Also, the engine type may also be missing if it cannot be deduced from the source."
